OL,3,AUS approves sale of 500 Patriot
OL,4,Amissiles to Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has approved the sale of 500
OL,7,FPatriot missiles to Ukraine, a
OL,8,Fcritically-needed munition for defence
OL,9,Fagainst escalating Russian aerial
OL,10,Fattacks, after Kyiv said deliveries had
OL,11,Fbeen delayed in recent months.
OL,13,FThe US State Department said the
OL,14,Fadvanced PAC-3 interceptor missiles
OL,15,Fwould cost $2.1bn (#1.6bn) and would be
OL,16,F"funded entirely" by Kyiv's allies in
OL,17,FEurope and Canada.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
